7,Pintupi Luritja,https://ictv.com.au/languages/pintupi-luritja?start=40,"Performed in Pintupi-Luritja, this video was created as a part of the Therrka Endangered Languages Project. (Scroll down for lyrics and translations). --- Visit: www.caamamusic.com.au This project has been assisted by the Australian Government through the Indigenous …",Pintupi-Luritja,Australian
8,Pintupi-Luritja: The Uluru Statement from the Heart | SBS English,https://www.sbs.com.au/language/english/en/podcast-episode/pintupi-luritja-the-uluru-statement-from-the-heart/m4joumvms,"July 4, 2021 - The Statement seeks to establish a relationship between Australia's First Nations peoples and the Australian nation based on truth, justice and self-determination. Music by Frank Yamma.",Pintupi-Luritja,Australian
9,Keeping language strong through song. | Australian Aboriginal Languages Student Blog,https://australianlanguages.wordpress.com/2018/05/18/keeping-language-strong-through-song/,"May 18, 2018 - Whilst they started playing desert reggae they eventually found their way to something a little bit harder and more accessible commercially. But most importantly, their songs regularly feature lyrics from a range of different Australian languages such as Pintupi-Luritja, Pitjantjatjara, Pertame Central Arrernte, Alywarre, Kaytitj and Islander.",Pintupi-Luritja,Australian
